        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ebibalikho",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nihenga olwa Likondi liafunaka shilala khubibalikho ebio musaafu, nimbulila shilala khubilimwoyo ebio bine nishiboola nomwoyo okwingana omukukumo, shiri Yitsa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndahenga, nindola ifarasi indafu njieyo; noyo owali niyeekhaalekhwo yali nobuyingo. Yaheebwa olusimbi, narula nahulanga, mbu ahulile elala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yafunaka eshibalikho shiakhabili, ndahulila eshilimwoyo shiakhabili nishiboola shiri Yitsa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eyindi niyirula, ifarasi inzakhanyu; noyo owali niyeekhaalekhwo yafuchiililwa okhuyinia omulembe mushialo, mbu abandu beeranenje; naye yaheebwa olukanga olukali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yafunaka eshibalikho shiakhataru, ndahulila eshilimwoyo shiakhataru nishiboola shiri Yitsa! Ndahenga, nindola if arasi imali njieyo; noyo owali niyeekhaalekhwo yali neshichelelo mumukhonokwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbulila omwoyo okufwana shinga okurula hakari webilimwoyo ebio bine, nikuboola mbu Itinari khulwa eshibabal shiobusie bweingano; itinari khulwa ebibaba bitaru bieishayiri. Ne oroonoonia amafura neidivai ta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yafunaka eshibalikho shiakhane ndahulila omwoyo kweshilimwoyo shiakhane nikuboola kuri Yitsa! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndahenga, nindola if arasi eyali niyifumiire omubili shinga indwale njieyo; noyo owali niyeekhaalekhwo yakulikhwa mbu Oluumbe; Makombe naye namulonda inyuma. Nabo nibaheebwa obunyali khushitonye shiakhane shieshialo, okhwira nolukanga, neinzala, noluumbe, nende tsisolo tsinabulimo etsiomushialo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne olwa yafunaka eshibalikho shiakharaano ndalola mulwalo weshimalilo shiemisango emioya chia abo abali nibeerwa khulwa likhuwa liaNyasaye khandi khulwa obuloli obwa barumbulanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibalanjisia nomwoyo omukhongo bari E Nabongo, iwe omutakatifu khandi owatoto, okhuula liina kho olakhalache eshiina nomala eshikwoli shiamatsayi keefwe khubamenya mushialo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nibaheebwa buli mulala ingubo irambi indafu; nibaboolelwa mbu bakhole nibashihuluukhakhwo, okhuula olwa abasumba abashiabwe bosi nende abaana babwe, abakhabe nibali okhwirwa shinga bo, bakhabe nibahelile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalola olwa yafunaka eshibalikho shiakhasasaba; mana eshialo shiarenga obutinyu; eliuba nalio nilimaliha ti, shinga ingubo yeikanichi, omwesi nikukwa shinga amabanga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tsinyininyini etsiomwikulu nitsiakukha khushialo, shinga omukhuyu olwa kubungulusia amakhuyu; kakwo nikashili amachiishi, olwa omuyeka omukhongo kuba nikukureesia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likulu nalio liarusibwaho, shinga likanya liamahandiiko nilikanywa; buli shikulu nende buli shikhalachinga shiosi nibirusibwa habundu wabio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo abaruchi beshialo, nabakhulundu, nabaseesia abakhongo, nabayinda, nabetsingufu, kata nende buli mundu yesi, nali omusumba kata nali omundu omwibule, nibeebisa mumbinga nende munyanda etsiomubikulu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nibasunjila ebikulu netsinyanda bari Khukwile, mukhubise khurule mumoni tsia oyo owikhaale khushifumbi shioburuchi, nomuburima bweLikondi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba induukho ikhongo yoburima bwabwe yulile; ne niwina owakhanyala okhusimbiila?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
